<Project>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Copyright>Copyright © 2013-$([System.DateTime]::Now.Year) Akka.NET Team</Copyright>
    <Authors>Akka.NET Team</Authors>
    <VersionPrefix>1.6.0-beta6</VersionPrefix>
    <PackageIcon>akkalogo.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://getakka.net/</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>Apache-2.0</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <!-- 
      xUnit1031 is a temporary fix, we will need to pay this technical debt 
      and make everything fully async in the future 
    -->
    <!-- 
      xUnit1051 is to suppress xUnit oppinionated cancellation token warning. 
    -->
    <NoWarn>$(NoWarn);CS1591;xUnit1013;xUnit1031;CS8632;xUnit1051;SYSLIB0050;SYSLIB0051;CS0672;CA2022</NoWarn>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <!-- Verify (snapshot tests) looks for the solution only two folders above a project, and its build props flow
       into every test project that references the shared test kit. Point it at the repo root so a single test
       project still builds on its own (dotnet test src/core/Akka.Streams.Tests). -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(SolutionDir)' == '' Or '$(SolutionDir)' == '*Undefined*'">
    <SolutionDir>$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)</SolutionDir>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <!-- Set the language version for C# if we're not inside an F# project -->
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(MSBuildProjectExtension)' == '.csproj'">
    <LangVersion>12.0</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <XunitVersion>2.8.1</XunitVersion>
    <Xunit3Version>3.2.2</Xunit3Version>
    <Xunit3RunnerVersion>3.1.5</Xunit3RunnerVersion>
    <XunitRunnerVersion>2.8.1</XunitRunnerVersion>
    <TestSdkVersion>18.7.0</TestSdkVersion>
    <HyperionVersion>0.12.2</HyperionVersion>
    <NewtonsoftJsonVersion>[13.0.1,)</NewtonsoftJsonVersion>
    <NBenchVersion>2.0.1</NBenchVersion>
    <ProtobufVersion>3.36.2</ProtobufVersion>
    <GrpcToolsVersion>2.84.0</GrpcToolsVersion>
    <BenchmarkDotNetVersion>0.15.8</BenchmarkDotNetVersion>
    <MessagePackVersion>3.1.12</MessagePackVersion>
    <MicrosoftDataSqliteVersion>10.0.12</MicrosoftDataSqliteVersion>
    <MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpVersion>4.13.0</MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpVersion>
    <MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpTestHarnessVersion>5.9.0</MicrosoftCodeAnalysisCSharpTestHarnessVersion>
    <NetTestVersion>net10.0</NetTestVersion>
    <FsharpVersion>10.1.302</FsharpVersion>
    <NetStandardLibVersion>net10.0</NetStandardLibVersion>
    <FluentAssertionsVersion>5.10.3</FluentAssertionsVersion>
    <ProduceReferenceAssembly>true</ProduceReferenceAssembly>
    <FsCheckVersion>3.6.0</FsCheckVersion>
    <FsCheck3Version>3.3.3</FsCheck3Version>
    <CsCheckVersion>4.9.1</CsCheckVersion>
    <HoconVersion>2.0.3</HoconVersion>
    <ConfigurationManagerVersion>6.0.1</ConfigurationManagerVersion>
    <MicrosoftLibVersion>[6.0.*,)</MicrosoftLibVersion>
    <MsExtVersion>[10.0.0,)</MsExtVersion>
    <MsExtTestVersion>10.0.10</MsExtTestVersion>
    <OpenTelemetryVersion>[1.15.3,)</OpenTelemetryVersion>
    <AkkaAnalyzerVersion>0.3.3</AkkaAnalyzerVersion>
    <VerifyXunitV3Version>31.24.2</VerifyXunitV3Version>
    <VerifyDiffPlexVersion>3.0.0</VerifyDiffPlexVersion>
    <AkkaPackageTags>akka;actors;actor model;Akka;concurrency</AkkaPackageTags>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TreatWarningsAsErrors>true</TreatWarningsAsErrors>
    <CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>true</CopyLocalLockFileAssemblies>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>Akka.NET 1.6.0-beta6 adds top-level C# 15 union serialization and makes distributed data the default store for cluster sharding coordinator state. Read the [v1.6 getting started guide](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/blob/dev/GETTING_STARTED_V1.6.md) for the full upgrade path.

**Serialization V2**

* C# 15 unions can now be sent or persisted as top-level messages with `[AkkaSerializable(Manifest = "...")]`. Deserialization reconstructs the boxed union, so `Receive&lt;TUnion&gt;` and `Recover&lt;TUnion&gt;` handlers continue to match. Closed generic unions register each construction with `[AkkaSerializerIncludes&lt;T&gt;]`. Standalone cases retain their own manifests, and explicitly included types discovered in referenced assemblies no longer cause duplicate registrations. ([#8908](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/pull/8908), fixes [#8906](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/issues/8906))
* Top-level unions use their own manifest with the existing union-field payload frame. Writing `default(TUnion)` at the top level throws `SerializationException`; field nil semantics are unchanged. AKKASG051 now requires an explicit manifest on a marked union. Reordering cases preserves the wire format; adding cases requires readers to upgrade before writers use them, and removing cases prevents reading stored values of those cases. Switching between a union and a closed hierarchy still requires a migration for top-level messages. ([#8908](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/pull/8908))

**Akka.Cluster.Sharding - behavior change**

* `akka.cluster.sharding.state-store-mode` now defaults to `ddata` instead of `persistence`. Coordinator state is replicated through Akka.DistributedData. The previous default silently used the in-memory journal when no durable journal was configured, losing coordinator state when the coordinator moved. ([#8905](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/pull/8905), addresses [#8903](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/issues/8903))
* **Migration:** set `akka.cluster.sharding.state-store-mode = persistence` explicitly to preserve the previous behavior. With `remember-entities = on`, the new default follows `remember-entities-store`, which defaults to `ddata`, rather than forcing the event-sourced store. Set `akka.cluster.sharding.remember-entities-store = eventsourced` to keep reading remembered entities from the journal. See the [v1.6 breaking-change ledger](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/blob/dev/BREAKING_CHANGES_V1.6.md). ([#8905](https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net/pull/8905))

2 contributors since release 1.6.0-beta5

| COMMITS | LOC+ | LOC- | AUTHOR          |
|---------|------|------|-----------------|
| 2       | 328  | 30   | Aaron Stannard  |
| 1       | 1    | 1    | dependabot[bot] |</PackageReleaseNotes>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup Label="Analyzers" Condition="'$(MSBuildProjectName)' != 'Akka'">
    <PackageReference Include="Akka.Analyzers" Version="$(AkkaAnalyzerVersion)" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <!-- SourceLink support for all Akka.NET projects -->
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.SourceLink.GitHub" Version="10.0.303" PrivateAssets="All" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)\docs\images\akkalogo.png" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="\" />
    <None Include="$(MSBuildThisFileDirectory)\README.md" Pack="true" Visible="false" PackagePath="\" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <!--<PublishRepositoryUrl>true</PublishRepositoryUrl>-->
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/akkadotnet/akka.net</RepositoryUrl>
    <!-- Optional: Embed source files that are not tracked by the source control manager in the PDB -->
    <EmbedUntrackedSources>true</EmbedUntrackedSources>
    <!-- Optional: Build symbol package (.snupkg) to distribute the PDB containing Source Link -->
    <IncludeSymbols>true</IncludeSymbols>
    <SymbolPackageFormat>snupkg</SymbolPackageFormat>
  </PropertyGroup>
</Project>